#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Amazon immovable: Cocoa Tree Old
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/amazons/units.lua:1194
msgid "The beans on this cocoa tree are ready for harvesting."
msgstr "这棵可可树上的豆子可以收获了。"

